<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-generated adventure stories</strong>, delivered in text or image+text formats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Quiet Note from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still growing! We\u2019re actively adding new features and modules over time.<br>If there\u2019s something you really wish it could do, let us know!<br>We can\u2019t promise everything will make it in, but we seriously read all suggestions\u00a0<br>(Just don\u2019t forget\u00a0\u2014 even AIs and devs need a little rest )</p>",
